
User.data Convert - (AmiExpress -> LogicBBS)

Copy your current USER.DATA file into RAM:

Make sure your NEW "BBS:" path is assigned to LogicBBS and NOT /X.
The program will create its own "USERS" directory if its not found in your
BBS: directory.


1. Start the USERDATA.CV program.

1a. When its finished you will find a LOG file in RAM:, and a USERLIST.BBS
    file. the USERLIST.BBS must be copied to your BBS: directory.

2. You do:

   Copy RAM:USERLIST.BBS to BBS:


3. View the LOGFILE "RAM:UserCV.Log" and make sure all USERTYPEs are created
   in your BBS:USERTYPE directory, if not, then make them.


4. View the LOGFILE "RAM:UserCV.Log" and make sure all ACCESSLEVELs are
   created in your BBS:ACCESSLEVEL directory, if not, then create those
   that you need.


NOTE:

  Users selected transfer protocol if default set to 1. So if you
  want to make sure all users, is not starting with a wrong transfer
  protocol, then put Zmodem protocol as 1, in the PROTOCOLS setup.


Thats it.
